{"type":"standard","title":"Tom Barrett (Michigan politician)","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Tom Barrett (Michigan politician)</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q18684588","titles":{"canonical":"Tom_Barrett_(Michigan_politician)","normalized":"Tom Barrett (Michigan politician)","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Tom Barrett (Michigan politician)</span></span>"},"pageid":44731425,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8b/Tom_Barrett%2C_official_portrait_%28119th_Congress%29.jpg/330px-Tom_Barrett%2C_official_portrait_%28119th_Congress%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":330,"height":413},"originalimage":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/8b/Tom_Barrett%2C_official_portrait_%28119th_Congress%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","width":3360,"height":4200},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1376016038","tid":"0ce9d948-b5c6-11f1-ac10-72704b3219fd","timestamp":"2026-09-21T14:09:25Z","description":"American politician (born 1981)","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tom_Barrett_(Michigan_politician)","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tom_Barrett_(Michigan_politician)?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tom_Barrett_(Michigan_politician)?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Tom_Barrett_(Michigan_politician)"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tom_Barrett_(Michigan_politician)","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Tom_Barrett_(Michigan_politician)","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tom_Barrett_(Michigan_politician)?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Tom_Barrett_(Michigan_politician)"}},"extract":"Thomas More Barrett is an American politician, financial analyst, and former U.S. Army officer serving as the U.S. representative for Michigan's 7th congressional district since 2025. A Republican, he previously served in the Michigan Senate from 2019 to 2023 and in the Michigan House of Representatives from 2015 to 2019. His congressional district covers a seven-county area that includes Lansing.","extract_html":"<p><b>Thomas More Barrett</b> is an American politician, financial analyst, and former U.S. Army officer serving as the U.S. representative for Michigan's 7th congressional district since 2025. A Republican, he previously served in the Michigan Senate from 2019 to 2023 and in the Michigan House of Representatives from 2015 to 2019. His congressional district covers a seven-county area that includes Lansing.</p>"}